#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_api_stock_scale
msgid ""
"\n"
"Báscula HTTP API\n"
"================\n"
"\n"
"HTTP transport for the AgroMarin scale-station fleet (V3). Replaces the MQTT\n"
"bridge; no MQTT, no paho.\n"
"\n"
"Endpoints\n"
"---------\n"
"* ``POST /web/hook/<uuid>`` -- Confirm-Tarima ingest through a\n"
"  ``automation.rule`` on_webhook rule, HMAC-SHA256 verified; delegates to the\n"
"  transport-agnostic ``stock.scale._get_or_create_scale_from_confirm()``\n"
"* ``POST /api/webhook/<uuid>`` -- compatibility alias for the same rule, kept\n"
"  because the deployed RPi stations hardcode the path the retired\n"
"  ``api_webhook`` module used to serve. Same rule, same HMAC, same replay and\n"
"  rate-limit checks. Remove it once every station posts to ``/web/hook/``\n"
"* ``GET /api/v1/pickings/<warehouse_code>`` -- catalog snapshot; bearer auth,\n"
"  ETag/304\n"
"* ``GET /api/v1/config/<station_id>`` -- per-station configuration; bearer auth,\n"
"  ETag/304\n"
"* ``POST /api/v1/validate-picking`` -- picking validation; bearer auth\n"
"\n"
"Inbound auth, replay protection and rate limiting come from core\n"
"``automation.rule``; encrypted secrets from ``credential``.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_crm_extract
msgid ""
"\n"
"CRM - Document Extraction\n"
"=========================\n"
"\n"
"A scanned business card is a document like any other: this bridge reads cards\n"
"under extract's ``business_card`` schema, through the extract cascade -- a vision\n"
"model reached through ``gateway_ml``, under the purpose\n"
"``extract.business_card``, answering to the company's data policy -- and maps\n"
"each card onto a lead, falling back to Odoo's IAP text generation when the\n"
"cascade reads nothing.\n"
msgstr ""

