#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_substance_autocomplete
msgid ""
"\n"
"Chemical Substance Autocomplete\n"
"===============================\n"
"\n"
"Enriches ``product.substance`` records on demand from the free PubChem PUG-REST\n"
"API (NIH) -- no API key required. Given a name or CAS number, fills in the CAS\n"
"Registry Number, IUPAC chemical name, molecular formula and molecular weight.\n"
"\n"
"Same approach as ``partner_autocomplete``: the CAS/PubChem registry is far too\n"
"large to ship as static data, so identity is fetched per record when the user\n"
"asks for it, rather than stored wholesale.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_substance
msgid ""
"\n"
"Chemical Substances\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"Generic registry of chemical substances keyed by their CAS Registry Number,\n"
"with a reusable set of intrinsic properties (physical/chemical, toxicological,\n"
"ecotoxicological, other).\n"
"\n"
"Substances are shared reference data: products list their substances (active\n"
"ingredients / components), and other modules (safety data sheets, regulatory,\n"
"quality) reference the same registry instead of re-typing chemical identity and\n"
"property data per product.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
