#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_geoengine
msgid ""
"\n"
"Geospatial support for Odoo\n"
"===========================\n"
"\n"
"Adds first-class geographic data to Odoo, backed by PostGIS and rendered with\n"
"OpenLayers:\n"
"\n"
"* **Geometry fields** -- ``geo_point``, ``geo_line``, ``geo_polygon`` and their\n"
"  multi-variants, stored as native PostGIS geometries with automatic SRID\n"
"  reprojection on read, write, import and export.\n"
"* **Spatial search** -- domain operators (``geo_intersect``, ``geo_contains``,\n"
"  ``geo_within``, ``geo_dwithin`` ...) optimized into indexed PostGIS queries.\n"
"* **Map view** -- an interactive ``geoengine`` view type with vector/raster\n"
"  layers, classification styling (choropleth, proportional, categorized),\n"
"  WebGL rendering for large datasets, and in-map drawing/editing.\n"
"* **Tools** -- GeoJSON/Shapefile/GeoPackage import/export, historical trail\n"
"  generation, and a guided setup wizard for PostGIS configuration.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_in_purchase_stock
